  "version": 1,
  "title": "The Broughton--Huff theorem on increasing unions of sigma-fields",
  "abstract": "A Lean formalization of the Broughton--Huff theorem that the ordinary union of a strictly increasing sequence of sigma-fields is not a sigma-field. The proof also proves the existence of a set measurable in the lattice supremum but in none of the individual sigma-fields.",
